== a lock inside a member
zs: zs.lock belongs to the workspace at ../zs.toml, which has the one lock; delete it and run zs fetch at the root
== zs run and zs add at the root
zs: zs run: a workspace; run a member (app, tool, libs/text), or a file
zs add: a workspace; run it in a member (app, tool, libs/text)
